Bạn cần sửa SP **`SIM_Science_Update`** (và **`SIM_Science_Add`**, **`SIM_Science_Search`**) cho khớp với BO/DAO. Script mẫu:

### `SIM_Science_Update`

```sql
ALTER PROCEDURE [dbo].[SIM_Science_Update]
(
    @ScienceID nvarchar(50),
    @ScienceName nvarchar(500) = NULL,
    @Manager nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @HeadTeacherID nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @SubTeacherID nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @SubTeacherID2 nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @ModifiedBy nvarchar(50) = NULL
)
AS
BEGIN

    SET NOCOUNT OFF

    UPDATE [SIM_Science]
    SET
        [ScienceName] = (CASE WHEN @ScienceName IS NULL THEN [ScienceName] ELSE @ScienceName END),
        [Manager] = (CASE WHEN @Manager IS NULL THEN [Manager] ELSE @Manager END),
        [HeadTeacherID] = (CASE WHEN @HeadTeacherID IS NULL THEN [HeadTeacherID] ELSE @HeadTeacherID END),
        [SubTeacherID] = (CASE WHEN @SubTeacherID IS NULL THEN [SubTeacherID] ELSE @SubTeacherID END),
        [SubTeacherID2] = (CASE WHEN @SubTeacherID2 IS NULL THEN [SubTeacherID2] ELSE @SubTeacherID2 END),
        [ModifiedBy] = (CASE WHEN @ModifiedBy IS NULL THEN [ModifiedBy] ELSE @ModifiedBy END),
        [ModifiedAt] = GETDATE()
    WHERE
        [ScienceID] = @ScienceID

END
```

### `SIM_Science_Add` (nếu chưa sửa)

```sql
ALTER PROCEDURE [dbo].[SIM_Science_Add]
(
    @ScienceID nvarchar(50),
    @ScienceName nvarchar(500) = NULL,
    @Manager nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @HeadTeacherID nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @SubTeacherID nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @SubTeacherID2 nvarchar(50) = NULL,
    @CreatedBy nvarchar(50) = NULL
)
AS
BEGIN

    SET NOCOUNT OFF

    INSERT INTO [SIM_Science]
    (
        [ScienceID],
        [ScienceName],
        [Manager],
        [HeadTeacherID],
        [SubTeacherID],
        [SubTeacherID2],
        [CreatedBy],
        [CreatedAt]
    )
    VALUES
    (
        @ScienceID,
        @ScienceName,
        @Manager,
        @HeadTeacherID,
        @SubTeacherID,
        @SubTeacherID2,
        @CreatedBy,
        GETDATE()
    )

END
```

